      "stealth": {
        "value": 10,
        "details": "<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Check[type:perception|dc:20|name:To Hear Faint Piano Music|traits:complex,haunt,hazard] (expert)</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">To Hear Faint Piano Music</span></li>\n</ul>"
      },
      "emitsSound": "encounter",
      "immunities": [],
      "weaknesses": [],
      "resistances": []
    },
    "details": {
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 3
      },
      "disable": "<ul>\n<li>@Check[type:religion|dc:20|name:Once to quiet the Spirit|traits:complex,haunt,hazard] (expert)&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">Once to quiet the Spirit.</span></li>\n<li>@Check[type:occultism|dc:20|name:Once to quiet the Spirit|traits:auditory,complex,haunt,sonic,hazard] (expert) to&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">Once to quiet the Spirit.</span></li>\n</ul>",
      "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">As ghostly music emanates from the piano, a ghostly woman in a ballroom gown shimmers in the air and takes your hand, leading you in a dance... </span></p>\n<p><strong>Vengful Haunt</strong>: This Haunt only affects those haunted by Jescha Foxglove, Alderns murdered wife who desires vengance for their murder. If no creatures in a group are haunted by Jescha Foxglove this haunt may target any creature.</p>",
      "reset": "<p>This Haunt automatially resets after one day until the supernatural Fungus in B37 is dealt with, even if the haunt was previously disabled.</p>",
      "routine": "<p><strong style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dance&nbsp;<strong><span class=\"pf2-icon\">R</span></strong></strong><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trigger&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">A Creature touches any of the piano keys - Haunted character must make a&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">&nbsp;@Check[type:will|dc:23|name:Suggestion|traits:mental,incapacitating,linguistic,necromancy,occult] save to avoid&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">or be drawn into the Haunt's routine.</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"text-align: justify;\">Routine</strong><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">: For <span style=\"text-align: start;\">[[/r {1d6}]]</span>&nbsp;rounds, the Haunt and any creature caught by &ldquo;Dance\" continue to dance. The dancing creature must make a&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: start;\">@Check[type:performance|dc:17]</span> check each round, or have their @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled} value increase by 1, to a maximum of @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled} 4. This enfeebled condition is reduced by 1 after a full night's rest. Any creature whose enfeebled value would increase beyond 4, or any creature who is enfeebled when the routine ends, becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.HL2l2VRSaQHu9lUw]{Fatigued}.</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"text-align: justify;\">Wrathful Shriek:<span class=\"pf2-icon\">&nbsp;R</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trigger</strong><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"> A creature caught in the haunt&rsquo;s routine is successfully grappled or restrained. All creatures in B7 must make a&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: start;\">@Check[type:will|dc:23|name:Suggestion|traits:mental,incapacitating,linguistic,necromancy,occult] save</span>.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Failure</strong>: </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">[[/r 4d6[mental]]] damage and </span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied}</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Critical Failure</strong>:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">[[/r 4d6[mental]]] damage and </span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2}</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">This stupeﬁed condition reduces by 1 after a full night&rsquo;s rest.</span></p>",
